  "name": "Prepared Defenses",
  "type": "feature",
  "system": {
    "attribution": {},
    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to have an adversary deploy a defensive measure against a PC, such as firing a pre-loaded crossbow, dropping falling rocks, or revealing a spike trap. The PC must succeed on an Agility Reaction Roll or take <strong>1d8+3</strong> physical damage and become <em>Vulnerable</em> until they next act.</p><hr><p><em>What defensive measure do they use? What specific threat was the garrison preparing for?</em></p>",
